consistency-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/consistency-type;4.0.1;FluidConsistencyTypeCodes;Fluid Consistency Type Codes;draft;False;FluidConsistencyType :  Codes used to represent the consistency of fluids and liquids provided to the patient. This value set includes concepts from [SNOMED CT](http://snomed.info/sct)(US Extension) where concept is a 435681000124103  (Dietary liquid consistency diet (regime/therapy)). It is provided as a suggestive example.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;FHIR NutritionOrder team;;http://snomed.info/sct;439031000124108;honey thick liquid;;;
